From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Narayan Reddy <narayanr@nvidia.com>
Date: Sun, 24 Oct 2021 02:28:06 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 030/245] NVIDIA: SAUCE: net: phy: aqr113c: Enable Wake on boot
 configuration.

Enable wake on boot configuration. This feature
configures the Wake on LAN settings in PHY where
PHY detects the magic packet and generates an
interrupt to boot the device.

Bug 3270211

Change-Id: I4ee6d0ec7f9a1786337eefa8ce75b8f8a896a093
Signed-off-by: Narayan Reddy <narayanr@nvidia.com>
Signed-off-by: Revanth Kumar Uppala <ruppala@nvidia.com>
Reviewed-on: https://git-master.nvidia.com/r/c/linux-stable/+/2909744
Reviewed-by: Abhilash G <abhilashg@nvidia.com>
Reviewed-by: Laxman Dewangan <ldewangan@nvidia.com>
Tested-by: Abhilash G <abhilashg@nvidia.com>

